{
"content_id": "FLORA:4.2.2",
"reference_id": "FLORA:4.2.2",
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "标题：蓖麻（castor oil plant [castor bean plant]）",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "4.2.2",
"language": "zhs",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\nspan[data-bnType=\"bibleReference\"] { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"FLORA:4.2.2\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">4.2.2</span> 标题：蓖麻（castor oil plant [castor bean plant]）</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：קִיקָיוֹן</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：qiqayon)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jonah4:6\">JON 4:6</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jonah4:6\">JON 4:6</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jonah4:7\">JON 4:7</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jonah4:9\">JON 4:9</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jonah4:10\">JON 4:10</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">讨论</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p><figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0115_castor_leaf.jpg\" alt=\"蓖麻叶\"><figcaption class=\"thlex-caption\">蓖麻叶 (© I, MJJR (Wikimedia Commons))</figcaption></figure>从耶柔米和奥古斯丁时期以来，关于《约拿书》中的<em>qiqayon</em> 是什么植物就一直存在争议。祖海里、赫珀和莫尔登克都认为<em>qiqayon</em> 是指蓖麻（学名<em>Ricinus communis</em> ），并且<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New Jerusalem Bible (1985)\">NJB</abbr> 、FFB 、多本注释书和一些圣经百科全书都是照此而译。然而，<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"King James Version (1611)\">KJV</abbr> 中&quot;gourd&quot;（&quot;葫芦&quot;）的译法也有着悠久的历史，包括《七十士译本》（希腊文<em>kolocuntha</em> ；参<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"UBSFloraLexicon\" data-key=\"FLORA:5.2.6\" href=\"#FLORA:5.2.6\">5.2.6 野瓜（柯罗辛、苦西瓜、药西瓜）（wild gourd [colocynth, egusi, bitter apple]）</a> ）、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised English Bible (1989)\">REB</abbr> 、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New American Bible (1970)\">NAB</abbr> 、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Moffatt Translation (1926)\">Mft</abbr> 和<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"American Translation (Goodspeed, 1935)\">AT</abbr> 都依循此例。《拉丁文武加大译本》将<em>qiqayon</em> 译为<em>hedera</em> （&quot;常春藤&quot;；参<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"UBSFloraLexicon\" data-key=\"FLORA:1.10\" href=\"#FLORA:1.10\">1.10 常春藤 (ivy)</a> ），并且为《诺克斯译本》采用，但这种译法没有植物学上的支持。1985年，罗宾逊（Robinson）对耶柔米以来的文献进行了深入的研究，并勉强接受它是葫芦（colocynth，苦西瓜）。有些学者甚至提出，这可能是故事中插入的亚述文词语，只是为了使故事听起来具有异国风情，甚或这只是一个虚构的词。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p><figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0116_castor_stalk.jpg\" alt=\"蓖麻种柄\"><figcaption class=\"thlex-caption\">蓖麻种柄 (© Parvathisri (Wikimedia Commons))</figcaption></figure>蓖麻可以长到3米（10英尺）高，深绿色扇形叶子的宽度可以达到半米。茎上长有一串串带刺的圆形种子。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">特殊意义</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>古人将蓖麻子的油作为药用，通常是用作泻药。在《约拿书》中，这种植物是上帝和他固执的先知之间激烈对抗的关键元素。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻译</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>许多翻译者会在这里选择一个通称，以避免在&quot;葫芦&quot;和&quot;蓖麻&quot;之间做出选择，例如译成&quot;藤本植物&quot;（&quot;vine&quot;；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Contemporary English Version\">CEV</abbr> 、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New International Version (1984)\">NIV</abbr> ）或&quot;植物&quot;（&quot;plant&quot;；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised Standard Version (1952)\">RSV</abbr> 、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Bible\">GNB</abbr> ）。<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New Jewish Publication Society Version\">NJPSV</abbr> 译成拉丁文的&quot;蓖麻子&quot;。由于蓖麻最初是非洲植物，因此那里的大多数翻译者都会知道这种植物。有些翻译者可能更喜欢按照一种主要语言来音译这个词（例如，阿拉伯文<em>karwa</em> 、法文<em>ricin</em> 、葡萄牙文<em>ricino</em> 或<em>bofarera</em> 或<em>karapatero</em> 、西班牙文<em>catapucia</em> 或<em>higuera</em> 或<em>higuerillo</em> ），或者使用一个描述性短语，如&quot;枝叶茂盛的灌木&quot;。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
